ives a growing number of AI-written issues and pull requests, and new\nCONTRIBUTING.md:168:4. Pull requests follow [AI_POLICY.md](AI_POLICY.md): fill in the template,\nCONTRIBUTING.md:186:  issue or copy the bot's comment into a new issue or pull request.\nAI_POLICY.md:1:This project accepts AI generated Pull Requests, as long as the following guidelines are met.\nAI_POLICY.md:3:- The Pull Request must fill in the repository's pull request template.\nAI_POLICY.md:4:- The Pull Request must identify itself as AI generated, including the name of the agent used.\nAI_POLICY.md:5:- The Pull Request must link to a issue or discussion where a solution has been approved by a maintainer (@willmcgugan).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0196YhK1X25uh4znhydyVjgh","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
